#: ../../how-to/fitting/advanced_decomposition.ipynb:10002
#: ea595409979241a6b73b86474493413f
msgid "Decomposition Analysis: PCA, ICA, and Eigenmodes"
msgstr "分解解析: PCA・ICA と固有モード"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/advanced_decomposition.ipynb:10004
#: 16bd59e19cd8433aaa9a511ba058b16a
msgid ""
"This tutorial covers **Principal Component Analysis (PCA)** and "
"**Independent Component Analysis (ICA)** using `TimeSeriesMatrix`."
msgstr ""
"このチュートリアルでは `TimeSeriesMatrix` を使った **主成分分析（PCA）** と **独立成分分析（ICA）** を解説します。"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/advanced_decomposition.ipynb:10006
#: cd0a6167d9564156a46d17ade22eaf7e
msgid ""
"Both methods are available as high-level methods on `TimeSeriesMatrix` via "
"`pca()` / `ica()`, wrapping scikit-learn internally."
msgstr ""
"どちらも `tsm.pca()` / `tsm.ica()` という高レベル API として利用可能で、内部では scikit-learn "
"をラップしています。"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/advanced_decomposition.ipynb:10008
#: 9383624ae6c64ca1aa1ed96269cd4eec
msgid "**Use cases:**"
msgstr "**代表的なユースケース:**"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/advanced_decomposition.ipynb:10009
#: 32c73f03d8c548fb9606c4b0e947c5f7
msgid ""
"PCA: dimensionality reduction, decorrelation of correlated sensor channels"
msgstr "PCA: 次元削減、相関センサーチャンネルの非相関化"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/advanced_decomposition.ipynb:10010
#: cc6e9ff04ae44c138d711fe3f7aed340
msgid ""
"ICA: blind source separation (BSS), e.g., separating physical signals from "
"environmental noise"
msgstr "ICA: 盲目信号分離（BSS）— 環境ノイズから物理信号を分離する"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/advanced_decomposition.ipynb:10012
#: ddd294fc3cee40abb284e0b3532d2dc6
msgid ""
"**Legacy migration note:**   If your code used `sklearn.decomposition.PCA` "
"or `sklearn.decomposition.FastICA` directly, you can replace them with "
"`matrix.pca()` and `matrix.ica()`.   See the [Migration Guide for GWpy "
"Users](../../explanation/gwexpy_for_gwpy_users.md) and [GWpy Difference API "
"Index](../../reference/gwpy_added_api.md) for before/after migration "
"examples."
msgstr ""
"**レガシー移行メモ:** `sklearn.decomposition.PCA` や `sklearn.decomposition.FastICA` "
"を直接使っていた場合は、`matrix.pca()` と `matrix.ica()` に置き換えられます。移行前後の例は [GWpy "
"ユーザー向け移行ガイド](../../explanation/gwexpy_for_gwpy_users.md) と [GWpy 差分 API "
"一覧](../../reference/gwpy_added_api.md) を参照してください。"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/advanced_decomposition.ipynb:30002
#: 722ce2eef2c64bba97f612d4c571abe7
msgid "1. Prepare Synthetic Multi-channel Data"
msgstr "1\\. マルチチャンネル合成データの準備"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/advanced_decomposition.ipynb:30004
#: f02d0aeaf10e4ea8baac4d804722f587
msgid "We simulate a realistic scenario:"
msgstr "現実的なシナリオを再現します:"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/advanced_decomposition.ipynb:30005
#: 25dacbdad7af4560b2d537e01c87d7eb
msgid "Two **hidden sources**: a 10 Hz sine wave and broadband noise"
msgstr "**隠れた信号源** 2本: 10 Hz サイン波とブロードバンドノイズ"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/advanced_decomposition.ipynb:30006
#: 43c796dc258a41aebaab17df81389a81
msgid "Four **observed channels**: linear mixtures of the hidden sources"
msgstr "**観測チャンネル** 4本: 信号源の線形混合"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/advanced_decomposition.ipynb:30008
#: 031dacec77b249e195160d6d35228cfd
msgid ""
"This mirrors real-world scenarios in gravitational-wave detectors where "
"physical signals are mixed across multiple sensor channels."
msgstr "これは重力波検出器で複数のセンサーに物理信号が混合して現れる状況を模倣しています。"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/advanced_decomposition.ipynb:50002
#: b364fe1959e34032a7b37c1f8c86db81
msgid "2. PCA – Dimensionality Reduction"
msgstr "2\\. PCA – 次元削減"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/advanced_decomposition.ipynb:50004
#: d18361a9f2e84540aacdd4a8075fc611
msgid ""
"`TimeSeriesMatrix.pca()` returns the score matrix and, optionally, a "
"`PCAResult` object containing the fitted model."
msgstr "`TimeSeriesMatrix.pca()` はスコア行列と、オプションで `PCAResult` オブジェクトを返します。"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/advanced_decomposition.ipynb:90002
#: 8e250f36b3b6488cbdeb119e1052b80d
msgid "3. ICA – Blind Source Separation"
msgstr "3\\. ICA – 盲目信号分離"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/advanced_decomposition.ipynb:90004
#: a35d805495a24eebad5c67aa90051051
msgid "`TimeSeriesMatrix.ica()` runs FastICA and returns a source matrix."
msgstr "`TimeSeriesMatrix.ica()` は FastICA を実行し、独立成分行列を返します。"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/advanced_decomposition.ipynb:90006
#: 5e7b1370931e4416b12413a67353175b
msgid ""
"Unlike PCA (which finds directions of maximum variance), ICA finds "
"statistically independent sources — making it more suitable for separating "
"physically distinct noise contributions."
msgstr "PCA が分散最大方向を探すのに対し、ICA は統計的に独立な成分を探すため、 物理的に異なるノイズ源の分離に適しています。"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/advanced_decomposition.ipynb:120002
#: 057e7f9621644f29bc8723f75a2546ca
msgid "4. Preprocessing: Standardization and Whitening"
msgstr "4\\. 前処理：標準化とホワイトニング"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/advanced_decomposition.ipynb:120004
#: e5ad0b6bcd2b4fc3ae21dcda814eb01d
msgid ""
"ICA (and PCA) require data to be scaled appropriately. `TimeSeriesMatrix` "
"provides built-in preprocessing:"
msgstr "ICA・PCA にはスケーリングが重要です。`TimeSeriesMatrix` には組み込み前処理が備わっています:"

