msgstr "外れ値に強い中央値/MAD スケーリング"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/advanced_decomposition.ipynb
#: 1ff828efa4b14b6abd155a52638af2ca
msgid "`.whiten_channels()`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/fitting/advanced_decomposition.ipynb
#: 8f295e2735e542fea5d1e8257fa59018
msgid "PCA whitening – decorrelates channels"
msgstr "PCA ホワイトニング（チャンネル間相関の除去）"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/advanced_decomposition.ipynb:120012
#: 59819a6cb6ef485e92972436b03a5567
msgid ""
"The `pca()` and `ica()` methods accept a `scale` parameter to apply these "
"internally."
msgstr "`pca()` / `ica()` には `scale` パラメータで内部適用も可能です。"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/advanced_decomposition.ipynb:140002
#: 149830d904244d6493257196f0c5a0fb
msgid "5. Handling Missing Values (NaN)"
msgstr "5\\. 欠損値 (NaN) の取り扱い"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/advanced_decomposition.ipynb:140004
#: 0a979535dc214f538300fc0b357f8519
msgid ""
"Real detector data often contains gaps. Use `nan_policy='impute'` to handle "
"NaNs before decomposition."
msgstr "実際のデータには観測ギャップがある場合があります。`nan_policy='impute'` で分解前に補完できます。"

#: ../../how-to/fitting/advanced_decomposition.ipynb:160002
